PAIRED COMPARISONS
------------------
10,000 paired test-record draws; NumPy default_rng(0).
The same sampled indices are applied to every model. Correlations and ranks are recomputed within each draw.
Calibrators remain fixed; no calibration-fitting or initialization-seed resampling.
95% percentile intervals; unadjusted for multiple comparisons.
Positive delta favors the combination: reference minus candidate for RMSE/MAE; candidate minus reference for Pearson/Spearman/R2.
Results are conditional on the successful-extraction cohort.

